{"id":337,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"人間教育と学習習慣を育てる札幌大谷","feature_description":"札幌大谷中学校・高等学校は、親鸞聖人の教えを建学の精神とし、人間教育を行う進学校です。学習習慣と生活習慣を大切にしながら、進路達成をめざす方針が示されています。高校ではコースや学校生活の案内も整っており、特色を把握しやすい構成です。公式サイトの学校案内や教育ページが整理され、学びの方針と学校生活の両面を確認しやすいです。","clubs":[{"id":5706,"name":"硬式野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.s-ohtani.ed.jp/high/schoollife/club","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5707,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.s-ohtani.ed.jp/high/schoollife/club","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5708,"name":"女子バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.s-ohtani.ed.jp/high/schoollife/club","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5709,"name":"男子バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.s-ohtani.ed.jp/high/schoollife/club","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5710,"name":"男子サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.s-ohtani.ed.jp/high/schoollife/club","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5711,"name":"女子サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.s-ohtani.ed.jp/high/schoollife/club","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5712,"name":"水泳部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.s-ohtani.ed.jp/high/schoollife/club","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5713,"name":"陸上競技部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.s-ohtani.ed.jp/high/schoollife/club","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5714,"name":"フェンシング部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.s-ohtani.ed.jp/high/schoollife/club","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5715,"name":"ソフトテニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.s-ohtani.ed.jp/high/schoollife/club","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5716,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.s-ohtani.ed.jp/high/schoollife/club","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5717,"name":"体操部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.s-ohtani.ed.jp/high/schoollife/club","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":5718,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.s-o